{"path":"container/vector/front","title":"std::vector<T,Allocator>::front","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::vector&lt;T,Allocator&gt;::</span>front","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/vector/front","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a reference to the first element in the container.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">reference front<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">const_reference front<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a reference to the first element in the container.\n</p><p>Calling <code>front</code> on an empty container causes undefined behavior.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Reference to the first element.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>For a container <code>c</code>, the expression <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c.<span class=\"me1\">front</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>c.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\"><p>The following code uses <code>front</code> to display the first element of a <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>:</p>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cassert&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;vector&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector\"><span class=\"kw1277\">std::<span class=\"me2\">vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> letters<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">'a'</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'b'</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'c'</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'d'</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/error/assert\"><span class=\"kw778\">assert</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>letters.<span class=\"me1\">front</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"st0\">'a'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector/back\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>back</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  access the last element <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector/rend\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rend</span><span>crend</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns a reverse iterator to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector/begin\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>begin</span><span>cbegin</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns an iterator to the beginning <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/vector/data\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>data</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  direct access to the underlying contiguous storage <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/vector","title":"std::vector"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::vector<T,Allocator>::front","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Returns a reference to the first element in the container."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Reference to the first element."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Notes","note":"For a container c, the expression c.front() is equivalent to *c.begin()."},{"label":"Example","note":"The following code uses front to display the first element of a std::vector<char>:"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"back","note":"access the last element"},{"label":"rend, crend","note":"returns a reverse iterator to the end"},{"label":"begin, cbegin","note":"returns an iterator to the beginning"},{"label":"data","note":"direct access to the underlying contiguous storage"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":127,"codeBlockCount":1}
